??: Hey there, Nice to meet you! Welcome to the Magisterium police station of Magic Affairs, My name is Vane. 

- Hi there sir!
- What a pleasure to meet you!

Vane: I heard you've came from the country side. You're a graduate at the top Magic academy right?

- Yes sir!
	Vane: No need for the formalities.
- Absolutely!
	Vane: Love the enthusiasm!

Vane: Well, Let's cut to the chase... We got a call from [b][color=yellow]Nightshade Academy[/color][/b] about a magic related Incident, specifically alchemy.

Vane: I know you're currently still moving in so we've sent other detectives to the scene of the crime, however, I want you to go there soon to meet with the rest of them.

